  "description": "Lamire Modern – Elegant Editorial Serif Font\nElevate your creative designs with timeless elegance, high-fashion glamour, and refined editorial poise using Lamire Modern! Designed as a modern serif typeface, its slender letterforms combine delicate high contrast with artistic swashes, curved crossbars, and unique uppercase and lowercase ligatures that instantly turn any title into a custom luxury logo mark.\nPerfect for high-end luxury branding, boutique logos, editorial magazine covers, beauty packaging, romantic wedding invitations, chic social media layouts, and aesthetic quote art.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Lamire Modern – Elegant Editorial Serif Font</p>\n<p>Elevate your creative designs with timeless elegance, high-fashion glamour, and refined editorial poise using Lamire Modern! Designed as a modern serif typeface, its slender letterforms combine delicate high contrast with artistic swashes, curved crossbars, and unique uppercase and lowercase ligatures that instantly turn any title into a custom luxury logo mark.</p>\n<p>Perfect for high-end luxury branding, boutique logos, editorial magazine covers, beauty packaging, romantic wedding invitations, chic social media layouts, and aesthetic quote art.</p>",
